      "id": "e12",
      "time_offset_ms": 195000,
      "type": "show_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "Now let's zoom out to the full quarter. Monthly metrics gives us July at zero point zero five, August at zero point zero three, and September at zero point zero two. The trend looks like churn is improving through the quarter. Starting high in July, coming down through August and September. That story makes sense. The board might even feel good about it. Now let's see what churn events says about the full quarter.",
